# Agent-harness scratch. These are per-run notes from the grok-fleet pipeline;
# tracking them shipped a stale task brief and a failed test log inside the
# source tarball and every goreleaser archive.
.review.md
.task.md

# Compiled commands. `go build ./cmd/<name>` without -o drops the binary in the
# repository root, where a `git add -A` would otherwise commit 13 MB of object
# code into an unrelated change. tests/spec/tracked_artifacts_test.go enforces
# that every cmd/ name appears here.
/admin-gateway
/bridge
/recover
/vault
